    airo:evidenceText "The mother, Meg Garcia, filed the lawsuit Wednesday in Florida federal court." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3999" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8bf9c5528255> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Her teenage son killed himself after talking to a chatbot. Now she’s suing." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3987" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8f740b0da532> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "According to screenshots from the lawsuit, Setzer often engaged with chatbots who took on the identity of \"Game of Thrones\" characters. Many of those conversations revolved around love, relationships and sex, most notably with the character Daenerys Targaryen." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4004" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/924ca64937d1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Mother sues Google-owned Character.AI over son’s suicide, calling him “collateral damage” in a “big experiment”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4001" .

