    airo:evidenceText "[3997] A Florida mother is suing the artificial intelligence company Character.AI for allegedly causing the suicide of her 14-year-old son." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3997" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/96ad8d18baba> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "U.S District County Middle District of Florida Orlando Division" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4023" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97b4a04b4bb9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Jerry Ruoti, Character.AI's head of trust and safety, declined to tell The New York Times how many users are under 18 but acknowledged that many of them are young." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4023" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9832737baebe> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Garcia, who herself works as a lawyer, blamed Character.AI for her son's death in her lawsuit and accused the founders, Noam Shazeer and Daniel de Freitas, of knowing that their product could be dangerous for underage customers." ;
