<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9c497edc70db> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This action seeks to hold Defendants Character.AI, Shazeer, De Frietas (collectively, \"C.AI\"), and Google responsible for the death of 14-year-old Sewell Setzer III (\"Sewell\") through their generative AI product Character AI (\"C.AI\")." ;
