<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/acf403639ed5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4017] Megan Garcia filed a civil suit against Character.ai, which makes a customizable chatbot for role-playing... [4003] Megan Garcia, the mother of Sewell Setzer III, said Character.AI targeted her son with 'anthropomorphic, hypersexualized, and frighteningly realistic experiences'..." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4017" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/addd5a727518> a airo:Evidence ;
