<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8b3fa78bc99d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A lawsuit has been filed against Character.AI, its founders Noam Shazeer and Daniel De Freitas, and Google in the wake of a teenager’s death." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4015" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8e7ff93b766d> a airo:Evidence ;
