    airo:sourceDocId "3995" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8eecab4a1e6f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "implemented numerous new safety measures over the past six months, including a pop-up directing users to the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline that is triggered by terms of self-harm or suicidal ideation." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3993" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cab3c385bea1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As a company, we take the safety of our users very seriously,\" the spokesperson said, saying the company has implemented new safety measures over the past six months --- including a pop-up, triggered by terms of self-harm or suicidal ideation, that directs users to the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3989" .

